      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PIN DEEP (4) got over the top to score comfortably over this track and trip 3 weeks ago. This looks to shape similarly, though he has drawn an inside barrier this time around. Will need a touch of luck on straightening, but if the breaks come at the top of the straight, he'll be hard to hold out. PROSPECTOR'S PICK (5) brings in some fresh blood as he lands here first-up with two nice trials under his belt. He maps to get every chance in the run and he's a two-time winner fresh. Wouldn't surprise to see him come out on top today. AMAROO STAR (3) disappointed first-up when tiring late here but he usually improves with racing under his belt. He'd prefer the track a bit harder, but the booking of Fiore is a good push for his chances. Can improve quickly. GIRLS DAY OUT (7) missed in a photo here last time out in a high-rating performance. Can go one better. SWINGMAN (6) can improve with the fresh run under his belt.",
